// Repair Station - the Base's free upkeep service (the LobbyStart chunk's space ship), unlocked by Rift
// Anchor L2 (meta progression; spawned from the LobbyStart ChunkSpawnConfig under
// SharedTalentRequirement.RepairStation). Press-to-use through the same generic Base-Skill redirect as Healing
// Shrine (Interactable/ContextInteraction, see ContextInteraction.qtn): restores RepairPoints Accessory Guard
// blocks, no Coins. Radius lives on the sibling Interactable component. See RepairStationUtility.
//
// Not a PoiUsagePolicy: the charge ARMS WHEN A BREAK STARTS (not per BreathingIndex, which only ticks when a
// Break ends) - so it isn't ready at the start of a run, and once used it waits for the next Break.
component RepairStation
{
    PoiAvailability Availability;
    Int32 RepairPoints;
}

// Per player: how many Breaks had started when they last used a Repair Station (0 = never). Usable while
// RepairStationUtility.BreaksStarted is greater - see RepairStationUtility.CanUse.
component RepairStationUsage
{
    Int32 UsedAtBreaksStarted;
}
